"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{Li}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别是生产一单位商品 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 所需的资本和劳动投入（它们是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w/r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的函数）。给定商品价格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(P_1, P_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，这两个方程可以唯一确定要素价格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(w, r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——这就是FPE定理的数学基础。</p>\n<h3 id=\"雷布钦斯基定理\">雷布钦斯基定理</h3><p>在商品价格不变的条件下（小国假设），一种要素的增加将导致密集使用该要素的商品产出增加，另一种商品的产出绝对减少。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&gt;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{Q_1} &gt; \\hat{L} &gt; 0 &gt; \\hat{Q_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1412em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9859em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1412em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>（当劳动增加时，劳动密集型商品产出超比例增加）</p>\n<p>这一定理有重要的政策含义：大量移民流入可能改变一国的生产结构和贸易模式，但不会改变要素价格（在小国情况下）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"列昂惕夫悖论\">列昂惕夫悖论</h3><p>列昂惕夫（1953）用美国的投入-产出数据检验H-O理论时发现了著名的悖论：美国作为世界上资本最丰裕的国家，出口的商品反而比进口替代品更加劳动密集。</p>\n<p>对列昂惕夫悖论的解释包括：</p>\n<p><strong>人力资本</strong>：如果把人力资本（教育和技能）视为一种&quot;资本&quot;，美国工人因高人力资本而使得出口品的&quot;有效资本密集度&quot;实际上更高。</p>\n<p><strong>自然资源</strong>：美国进口了大量资源密集型产品（如石油），这些产品在生产中使用大量物质资本。</p>\n<p><strong>技术差异</strong>：H-O模型假设各国技术相同，但实际上美国在技术密集型产品上有优势，这些产品可能更多使用熟练劳动而非物质资本。</p>\n<p><strong>需求偏好差异</strong>：如果美国消费者对资本密集型商品的偏好特别强烈，可能抵消供给侧的比较优势。</p>\n<h3 id=\"特定要素模型\">特定要素模型</h3><p>保罗·萨缪尔森和罗纳德·琼斯提出的特定要素模型（Specific Factors Model）是H-O模型的短期变体。假设资本在部门间不可流动（特定要素），只有劳动是流动的。</p>\n<p>贸易自由化对各群体的影响：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>出口部门的特定要素所有者获益（确定）</li>\n<li>进口竞争部门的特定要素所有者受损（确定）</li>\n<li>劳动者的福利变化不确定（取决于消费结构）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这一模型更好地刻画了短期的政治经济现实：特定产业的资本所有者和工人会联合起来反对自由贸易（如美国钢铁行业），而不是像H-O模型预测的那样按要素类型分化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"当代验证与扩展\">当代验证与扩展</h3><p><strong>技能偏向的技术变迁</strong>：近几十年全球不平等加剧的一个解释是，技术进步和全球化共同提高了对高技能劳动的需求。在发展中国家，与发达国家的贸易增加了对中等技能工人的需求（因为这些国家的中等技能工人在全球范围内是&quot;低技能&quot;），改善了这一群体的收入。</p>\n<p><strong>贸易对工资的影响</strong>：奥托尔等人（2013）的研究发现，来自中国的进口竞争对美国制造业工人的工资和就业产生了显著负面影响（&quot;中国冲击&quot;），且受影响社区的恢复极其缓慢——与H-O/斯托尔珀-萨缪尔森的预测方向一致，但调整过程远比理论假设的困难。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>A国有100单位资本和200单位劳动，B国有200单位资本和100单位劳动。生产手机需要更多资本，生产服装需要更多劳动。根据H-O定理，预测两国的贸易模式。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>如果中国加大教育投资，显著提高了人力资本水平，这会如何改变中国与美国之间的贸易模式？用H-O框架分析。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>斯托尔珀-萨缪尔森定理意味着自由贸易会损害发达国家低技能工人的利益。从政策角度，应该如何平衡贸易利得和分配公平？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>全球供应链使得生产过程可以按工序拆分到不同国家。这对传统H-O模型有什么挑战？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>伯蒂尔·俄林因国际贸易理论获1977年诺贝尔经济学奖。保罗·萨缪尔森的一系列论文（1941、1948、1949）对H-O模型进行了严格的数学化处理。</p>\n<p>推荐阅读克鲁格曼、奥布斯特费尔德和梅利兹《国际经济学》第5-6章，或费恩斯特拉《国际贸易的高级理论》。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>H-O模型将贸易模式归因于要素禀赋差异，是比较优势理论的重要扩展。要素价格均等化定理和斯托尔珀-萨缪尔森定理揭示了贸易对收入分配的深刻影响。列昂惕夫悖论推动了理论的改进和扩展。尽管现实比模型复杂得多，H-O框架仍然是理解贸易与收入分配关系的基本工具。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"赫克歇尔-俄林模型","id":"赫克歇尔-俄林模型"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"模型的正式结构","id":"模型的正式结构"},{"level":3,"text":"雷布钦斯基定理","id":"雷布钦斯基定理"},{"level":3,"text":"列昂惕夫悖论","id":"列昂惕夫悖论"},{"level":3,"text":"特定要素模型","id":"特定要素模型"},{"level":3,"text":"当代验证与扩展","id":"当代验证与扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"比较优势理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/international-trade/trade-theory/comparative-advantage"},"next":{"title":"新贸易理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/international-trade/trade-theory/new-trade-theory"}}